msgid "Import the assets as linked data-block"
msgstr "Importera resurserna som länkade datablock"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileAssetSelectParams.import_method:'APPEND'
#. :src: bpy.types.UserAssetLibrary.import_method:'APPEND'
msgid ""
"Import the assets as copied data-block, with no link to the original asset "
"data-block"
msgstr ""
"Importera resurserna som kopierade datablock, utan länk till resursens "
"ursprungliga datablock"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileAssetSelectParams.import_method:'APPEND_REUSE'
msgid ""
"Import the assets as copied data-block while avoiding multiple copies of "
"nested, typically heavy data. For example the textures of a material asset, "
"or the mesh of an object asset, don't have to be copied every time this "
"asset is imported. The instances of the asset share the data instead"
msgstr ""
"Importera resurserna som kopierade datablock men undvik flera kopior av "
"kapslade, vanligtvis omfattande data. Texturerna i en materialresurs eller "
"meshen i en objektresurs behöver till exempel inte kopieras varje gång "
"resursen importeras. Resursens instanser delar i stället data"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileAssetSelectParams.instance_collections_on_link
msgid ""
"Create instances for collections when linking, rather than adding them "
"directly to the scene"
msgstr ""
"Skapa instanser av samlingar vid länkning i stället för att lägga till dem "
"direkt i scenen"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileSelectParams.filter_glob
